Package: aptfz
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), dpkg, apt
Recommends: fzf
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: interactive fzf and CLI explorer for installed apt packages
 aptfz browses the packages installed on a Debian-based system through an
 fzf picker with a colorized live preview; aptq runs the same query engine
 non-interactively and prints one package name per line.
 .
 Filter by install reason (manual/automatic), by whether anything requires,
 recommends or suggests a package, search any field, sort, total up sizes,
 and attach personal notes to packages. The package cache refreshes itself
 whenever dpkg or apt-mark change what is installed.
